  "ruleText": "Lab 702.01 “Healthcare provider” means a hospital, physician or medical specialist offering services within the managed care system.\n\nSource.. #5788, eff 2-17-94; amd by #7143, eff 11-24-99; amd by #7212, INTERIM, eff 3-2-00, EXPIRED: 6-30-00\n\nNew. #7338, eff 8-2-00; ss by #9217, eff 8-1-08; ss by #12013, eff 10-25-16",
